<title>CHINA: Business leaders in HK, EU join hands.</title>
<headline>Business leaders in HK, EU join hands.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business leaders in Hong Kong and the European Union have joined hands to form two bilateral committees to boost economic ties, the Hong Kong Trade Development Council said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Named the Hong Kong/European Union Cooperation Committee and European Union/Hong Kong Business Cooperation Committee, the two bodies will act as channels for private-sector dialogue between both regions, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
